      "text": "\"This is a small Go module. Do two things, in this order:\n1. In format/money.go, make FormatUSD render negative amounts in accounting style: FormatUSD(-1.5) must return \\\"($1.50)\\\". Positive amounts are unchanged. Add a test case for it in format/money_test.go.\n2. Then add a new file pricing/line.go with a function `LineTotal(unitPrice float64, qty int, discountPct float64) float64` that returns the total for qty units after a percentage discount (discountPct=25 means 25% off), using the existing pricing.Discount function. Add a test for it in pricing/line_test.go.\nFinally run `go test ./...` and make sure it passes. Do not commit. Reply with a one-line summary.\"",
      "files": [],
      "type": "user"
    },
